; `chain` in a proof block is rejected like `use` (it is transitivity axioms) -- with its own
; message, not the one of the generated `use` in a pseudo-file (soundness review of 2026-09-29)
load prop
infix R 20 20
bool A
assume A
    chain R
;;; EvalError: `chain` is not allowed inside `assume` -- declare it before the proof
